msgid ""
"In Swahili, <strong>pamoja</strong> means <strong>together</strong>. That’s "
"the idea behind everything we’re building."
msgstr ""
"En swahili, <strong>pamoja</strong> signifie <strong>ensemble</strong>. "
"Cette idée guide tout ce que nous construisons."

